Dictionary data
---------------

The dictionary in dictionaries/zh-CN.json is a new compilation. Its sources:

1. Community seed: vibepm666/cursor-localization-zh
   https://github.com/vibepm666/cursor-localization-zh
   commit 88f93c685ac5d1bc645fbb5c3e3cc1ff1c16e2a7
   The upstream repository does not declare a license. Its English-to-Chinese
   pairs are used here as seed data / translation memory with attribution.
   If you are the rights holder and want the attribution changed or the seeded
   data removed, please open an issue in this repository.

2. MIT dictionary: Uncle-Gao/Live-Translator-Hub
   packages/patcher-cursor/i18n/dictionary.zh-CN.json (MIT)

3. MIT dictionary: lsh2253823857/cursor-i18n-tool
   https://github.com/lsh2253823857/cursor-i18n-tool
   commit a5dbf9ea7c1d915221cdf4de6af86bd69b7cc7ab (MIT)

4. Original additions by Javey-Li and contributors, licensed MIT as part of
   this repository.

The upstream vibepm666 runtime code (Python installer, JavaScript injection
engine, and related scripts) is NOT copied into this repository.

